      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "64 year old female with occluded left main after first injection brought to the operating room in extremis on IABP and maximum inotropes. LAD grafted with sapenous vein and immediate aorto-coronary perfusion. Circumflex grafted and patient taken to ICU. Patient discharged on POD #6 after echo shows normal ventricular with no wall motion abnormality."},
